  "version": "0.1.31-beta-test",
  "prepared_at_utc": "2026-10-22T16:02:23+00:00",
  "changes": [
    "Defer the original bound-inventory ordnance request until old station/camera interaction settles; submit once with unchanged actor/activator/action and maintenance choice. Bounded wait, player-interruption aborts and temporary native save protection; retain .30 UI changes and diagnostics. Test correction, no live fix claim."
  ],
  "validation": {
    "compile": "passed",
    "offline": "passed",
    "in_game": "not-run",
    "notes": [
      "Full supplied-reference compilation passed; 412 offline assertions passed (316 UI/depth/viewing/MP and 96 navigation/cleanup/deferred-handoff). Same-request identity, calm-state resets, interaction wait, timeout/actor/task/world/interface aborts and native save blockade release checked against independent API doubles. No live .31 test. ZIP CRC/source equality/Workshop ID verified."
    ]
  },
  "known_issues": [
    "Deferred-dispatch correction requires live validation; delayed native camera caller not definitively identified. Native unbound inventory/global queued tasks unchanged. Diagnostic hooks, native cleanup on abort, MP and UI placement require game tests. Exit crash and physical aft door/flood mismatch remain undiagnosed. Reference-tube preset and per-tube viewport dials queued only. No release/merge/Workshop upload."
  ],
